roundup/best-invoicing-apps-for-freelancers/","/guides/","/about/","/contact/","/editorial-policy/","/methodology/","/privacy-policy/","https://www.layer3labs.io"],"meta":{"description":"The 2027 401(k) contribution limit is $25,500, with higher catch-ups by age. The IRA limit stays $7,500. Your plan may set a lower deferral cap.","generator":"Astro v4.16.19","og:description":"The 2027 401(k) contribution limit is $25,500, with higher catch-ups by age. The IRA limit stays $7,500. Your plan may set a lower deferral cap.","og:image":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/favicon-192.png","og:site_name":"ModernWallet","og:title":"2027 Retirement Contribution Limits: 401(k), IRA, TSP","og:type":"website","og:url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/guides/retirement-contribution-limits-2027/","twitter:card":"summary_large_image","twitter:description":"The 2027 401(k) contribution limit is $25,500, with higher catch-ups by age. The IRA limit stays $7,500. Your plan may set a lower deferral cap.","twitter:image":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/favicon-192.png","twitter:title":"2027 Retirement Contribution Limits: 401(k), IRA, TSP","viewport":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"},"schema":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@id":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/#organization","@type":"Organization","description":"Free, accurate financial calculators — auto loans, mortgages, retirement, investing, rentals, and net worth. No signup, instant results.","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/favicon.svg"},"name":"ModernWallet","parentOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Layer3Labs","url":"https://www.layer3labs.io"},"url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@id":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/#website","@type":"WebSite","description":"Free, accurate financial calculators — auto loans, mortgages, retirement, investing, rentals, and net worth. No signup, instant results.","name":"ModernWallet","url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","item":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/","name":"ModernWallet","position":1},{"@type":"ListItem","item":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/guides/","name":"Guides","position":2},{"@type":"ListItem","item":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/guides/retirement-contribution-limits-2027/","name":"The 2027 401(k) Contribution Limit Rises to $25,500","position":3}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The 2027 employee deferral limit is $25,500. An eligible participant age 50 or older can generally add an $8,500 catch-up, for $34,000 total. At ages 60 to 63, the $11,750 higher catch-up gives a $37,250 total by our calculation, if the plan permits catch-up contributions."},"name":"What is the 401(k) contribution limit for 2027?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The $25,500 figure is an announced 2027 limit, not an estimate. The IRS announced it on November 12, 2026. An individual plan may still set a lower employee deferral cap."},"name":"Is the 2027 401(k) limit final or expected?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Roth and Traditional 401(k) employee contributions share the $25,500 deferral limit. They do not each receive a separate limit. An eligible catch-up may increase the total by age. Notice 2026-66 also states a $155,000 threshold used to determine whether certain 2027 catch-up contributions must be designated Roth."},"name":"What is the 2027 Roth 401(k) contribution limit?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The IRS lists the TSP with 401(k), 403(b) and governmental 457 plans at a $25,500 employee deferral limit for 2027. The listed catch-ups are generally $8,500 at age 50 or older and $11,750 at ages 60 to 63."},"name":"Is the TSP limit the same as the 401(k) limit for 2027?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The IRA contribution limit remains $7,500, and the age-50 catch-up remains $1,100. Several Traditional IRA deduction and Roth IRA contribution income phase-out ranges rise for 2027, depending on filing status and workplace-plan coverage."},"name":"Does the 2027 IRA limit change?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The higher catch-up is $11,750 instead of the general $8,500 catch-up for the listed 401(k), 403(b), governmental 457 and TSP plans. Adding $11,750 to the $25,500 employee deferral limit gives $37,250 by our calculation, if the plan permits the catch-up."},"name":"What is the catch-up limit for ages 60 to 63 in 2027?"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","description":"Jonathan Velez writes and edits ModernWallet's personal-finance content, focused on loans, interest, and debt payoff. Every calculator page is reviewed against primary sources like the CFPB and Federal Reserve.","jobTitle":"Personal Finance Writer & Editor","knowsAbout":["Auto loans","Loan amortization","Interest and APR","Debt payoff strategies","Personal finance"],"name":"Jonathan Velez","url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/about/","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ModernWallet","url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com"}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jonathan Velez","url":"https://www.themodernwallet.com/about/"},"citation":[{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"IRS: 401(k) limit increases to $25,500 for 2027, IRA limit remains $7,500","url":"https://www.irs.gov/newsroom/401k-limit-increases-to-25500-for-2027-ira-limit-remains-7500"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"IRS Notice 2026-66: 2027 Amounts Relating to Retirement Plans and IRAs","url":"https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-drop/n-26-66.pdf"},{"@type":"CreativeWork","name":"Thrift Savings Plan","url":"https://www.tsp.gov/"}],"dateModified":"2026-11-16","datePub